提。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1786373997981,"roundId":"round_1786373962839_vvyqlzs2z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22264},{"id":1786372299215,"text":"乖，再叫一声爸爸，马上就让你丢出来。","rawContent":"乖，再叫一声爸爸，马上就让你丢出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1786373997983,"roundId":"round_1786373962839_vvyqlzs2z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22265},{"id":1786372299216,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1786373998886,"roundId":"round_1786373962839_vvyqlzs2z","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"小坏蛋，夹着爸爸的手指还想说拜拜？门都没有。乖乖把水全流给爸爸，不许憋着。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22266},{"id":1786372299219,"text":"腿张到最大，还夹得这么紧？","rawContent":"腿张到最大，还夹得这么紧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1786374069304,"roundId":"round_1786374040411_8w4ba5vo7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22267},{"id":1786372299220,"text":"爸爸的手指都被你咬得拔不出来了，小贪心鬼。","rawContent":"爸爸的手指都被你咬得拔不出来了，小贪心鬼。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1786374069644,"roundId":"round_1786374040411_8w4ba5vo7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22268},{"id":1786372299221,"text":"揉豆豆就这么舒服？","rawContent":"揉豆豆就这么舒服？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1786374069646,"roundId":"round_1786